+    I eventually want to have plugins that allow keeping the cache in Berkeley DB, MySQL, etc.</li>
+    <li>More unit tests</li>
+</ul>
+
+<h3>Project Goal</h3>
+
+<p>To become a worthy addition to the Python core library.</p>
